        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Neither MCU has the specified crystal correctly connected to its HSE pins, preventing the intended external-clock operation and potentially preventing reliable startup or operation at the intended clock configuration.",
